xx0qq9d0vANClF6Hw","date":"2020-03-02T04:45:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8928026556968689,"text_excerpt":"Excellent pie. We all were very impressed. As professional chefs we are hard to please but they crushed it. Dough has some flop. They made it extra cheesy just the way I asked for it. Lost my job this week because of corporate cut backs but when asked they delivered a monumental pizza. Supreme with the meatballs. Extra cheese was on point. I will order again. Soon. Dough was perfect. Toppings were perfect. Way to go y'all. Hard to impress and you impressed us. Sincerely, unemployed. Zzz x"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vKBQmHjx5K9cYoGqWLyBhQ","photo_id":"FKvEtUskdve5ppcEii1GVg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/FKvEtUskdve5ppcEii1GVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9088903069496155},{"business_id":"vKBQmHjx5K9cYoGqWLyBhQ","photo_id":"U07OrzsEXKfi7l0SM3MMHw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/U07OrzsEXKfi7l0SM3MMHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8637611865997314},{"business_id":"vKBQmHjx5K9cYoGqWLyBhQ","photo_id":"OCP9ibFyu49ywBcLdbd_fQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OCP9ibFyu49ywBcLdbd_fQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8397316932678223},{"business_id":"vKBQmHjx5K9cYoGqWLyBhQ","photo_id":"hak1Px27ubi3APdx9aTmvw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hak1Px27ubi3APdx9aTmvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7922672033309937},{"business_id":"vKBQmHjx5K9cYoGqWLyBhQ","photo_id":"ZK3loE75UINO06ipYLFCAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZK3loE75UINO06ipYLFCAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7201824188232422}]},"notebook_case":null}
